<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MasTec cut to accumulate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MasTec cut to accumulate.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jefferies &amp; Co said its analyst Douglas Ashton has cut his rating on shares of MasTec Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not available.</p>
<p>-- MasTec shares were off 3-1/8 to 65-3/4 by midday.</p>
</text>
